# Copy to .env.local and fill in.

# Authenticates the GitHub Releases API calls behind the download buttons and
# the changelog, and lifts the unauthenticated 60 requests/hour rate limit.
#
# The product repository shreejitverma/cryozen is private today, so a token
# with `repo` scope is required for release data to resolve at all. Once the
# repository is public a token with no scopes is enough.
#
# Without a valid token nothing breaks: every GitHub call falls back to the
# releases page.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
